'''Farmer Rigby''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Farm}}'s main building. They have a cow, {{NPCSprite|Shania}}.

== Quest ==
'''Farmer Rigby''' gives the player the {{Quest|First Harvest}} [[Quest]] to gather {{Item|Wheat|amount=10}} to feed their sick [[Cow]], {{NPCSprite|Shania}}. In return, they will reward the player with {{Skill XP|100 Farming}}, {{SkyBlock XP|+5}}, and a {{Item|Rookie Hoe}}. Traveling to {{Zone|The Barn}} afterwards will grant another {{Skill XP|10 Farming}}.

